
! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''ji'a''

;__ji'a__ (UI3b): in addition.  This word is an attitudinal, that is, it directly expresses an emotion on the part of the speaker.  discursive: additionally(cf. jmina)
